e. <\/p><p>Performance redefined: simplify, achieve, and live your best moments.<\/p><p>Join us in creating meaningful change. <\/p>"}},"richtext_FarYmL":{"type":"richtext","disabled":true,"settings":{"content":"<p>Use this text to share information about your brand with your customers. Describe a product, share announcements, or welcome customers to your store.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["subheading_8MaaaG","heading_CLDfNM","richtext_EJiAAE","richtext_FarYmL"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-2","separate_section_with_border":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/natural-white-cotton-crumpled-soft-fabric-texture-background-surface_2.jpg","mobile_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/natural-white-cotton-crumpled-soft-fabric-texture-background-surface_2.jpg","reveal_on_scroll":true,"image_position":"end","content_width":"lg","remove_vertical_spacing":true}},"image_with_text_Hwbn96":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"subheading_ygPXHm":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"text":""}},"heading_zRCJT3":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"Investment in Wellness","heading_tag":"h2"}},"richtext_RhYGRw":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>Athloun blends the space between work, play, travel, and relaxation. Crafted for the dynamic lives of young achievers, each Athloun piece supports physical and emotional well-being. <\/p><p>We follow human-centric design approach aiming towards a lifestyle that balances movement and mindfulness. <\/p>"}}},"block_order":["subheading_ygPXHm","heading_zRCJT3","richtext_RhYGRw"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-080c1727-6f95-4618-afd7-718864cc40a0","separate_section_with_border":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/freepik__high-resolution-sharp-bright-defines-__90982.png","mobile_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/freepik__high-resolution-sharp-bright-defines-__90982.png","reveal_on_scroll":true,"image_position":"start","content_width":"sm","remove_vertical_spacing":true}},"image_with_text_bifPiW":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"subheading_XVnB48":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"text":""}},"heading_e4gqiL":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"Our Products","heading_tag":"h2"}},"richtext_G9BjyJ":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>We are committed to a sustainable future, focusing on reducing natural resource use across sourcing, production, and the entire supply chain. As of 2024, nearly 100% of our fabrics and finishes are plant-based. <\/p><p>We support a circular economy, minimise water and chemical footprints, and prioritise responsible innovation for a healthier planet. <\/p>"}}},"block_order":["subheading_XVnB48","heading_e4gqiL","richtext_G9BjyJ"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"color_scheme":"","separate_section_with_border":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Bamboo_Logo.jpg","reveal_on_scroll":true,"image_position":"end","content_width":"sm","remove_vertical_spacing":true}},"image_with_text_WCdMyw":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"subheading_EJqVjQ":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"text":""}},"heading_6bMjc4":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"Impact ","heading_tag":"h2"}},"richtext_yeENVn":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>Athloun is committed to a clean closet, cleaner planet. Our journey began with a vision to weave sustainability into every thread, driven by our commitment to the planet and its people. <\/p><p>We replace harmful chemicals and virgin polyester with natural, plant-based textiles. Each piece is crafted with the wearer in mind, aiming to minimize our ecological footprint.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["subheading_EJqVjQ","heading_6bMjc4","richtext_yeENVn"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"color_scheme":"","separate_section_with_border":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/MOUNTAIN_LOGO.jpg","reveal_on_scroll":true,"image_position":"start","content_width":"sm","remove_vertical_spacing":true}},"rich_text_9Ejkhf":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"subheading_iCaDdE":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"text":""}},"headin